msgctxt "#31441"
msgid "Ratings only from TMDb Helper"
msgstr "Graderings net van TMDb Helper"

msgctxt "#31442"
msgid "Show only the ratings TMDb Helper fetched for exactly this title. Off: the library's own rating (from Jellyfin) fills in while TMDb Helper has none."
msgstr "Wys net die graderings wat TMDb Helper vir presies hierdie titel gehaal het. Af: die biblioteek se eie gradering (van Jellyfin) vul in solank TMDb Helper geen het nie."

msgctxt "#31443"
msgid "Ratings only on title pages"
msgstr "Graderings net op titelblaaie"

msgctxt "#31444"
msgid "Spotlight and rows show no ratings, which saves requests to TMDb. A title's page still shows them."
msgstr "Kollig en rye wys geen graderings nie, wat versoeke aan TMDb spaar. 'n Titel se blad wys hulle steeds."

msgctxt "#31445"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Graderings"

msgctxt "#31446"
msgid "Sources"
msgstr "Bronne"

msgctxt "#31447"
msgid "Which ratings the ratings line of the spotlight and the info page shows, and where they come from."
msgstr "Watter graderings die graderingslyn van die kollig en die inligtingsblad wys, en waar hulle vandaan kom."

