msgctxt "#31460"
msgid "IMDb users, 0 to 10, with the Top 250 rank. Needs an OMDb or MDbList key in TMDb Helper."
msgstr "IMDb-gebruikers, 0 tot 10, met die Top 250-rang. Benodig 'n OMDb- of MDbList-sleutel in TMDb Helper."

msgctxt "#31461"
msgid "TMDb users, 0 to 10. Needs no key."
msgstr "TMDb-gebruikers, 0 tot 10. Benodig geen sleutel nie."

msgctxt "#31462"
msgid "Tomatometer: the share of positive critic reviews. Needs an OMDb or MDbList key in TMDb Helper."
msgstr "Tomatometer: die deel positiewe kritiese resensies. Benodig 'n OMDb- of MDbList-sleutel in TMDb Helper."

msgctxt "#31463"
msgid "Popcornmeter: the share of positive audience ratings. Needs an MDbList or OMDb key in TMDb Helper."
msgstr "Popcornmeter: die deel positiewe gehoorgraderings. Benodig 'n MDbList- of OMDb-sleutel in TMDb Helper."

msgctxt "#31464"
msgid "A weighted average of critic reviews, 0 to 100, mostly for theatrical films and big series. Needs an OMDb or MDbList key in TMDb Helper."
msgstr "Geweegde gemiddelde van kritiese resensies, 0 tot 100, meestal vir teaterflieks en groot reekse. Benodig 'n OMDb- of MDbList-sleutel in TMDb Helper."

msgctxt "#31465"
msgid "Trakt users, 0 to 10. Needs a connected Trakt account in TMDb Helper: fetched from Trakt, not MDbList."
msgstr "Trakt-gebruikers, 0 tot 10. Benodig 'n gekoppelde Trakt-rekening in TMDb Helper: van Trakt gehaal, nie MDbList nie."

msgctxt "#31466"
msgid "Letterboxd users, 0 to 5, mostly films. Needs an MDbList key in TMDb Helper."
msgstr "Letterboxd-gebruikers, 0 tot 5, meestal flieks. Benodig 'n MDbList-sleutel in TMDb Helper."

msgctxt "#31467"
msgid "MDbList score: an average of the other sources, 0 to 100. Needs an MDbList key in TMDb Helper."
msgstr "MDbList-telling: 'n gemiddelde van die ander bronne, 0 tot 100. Benodig 'n MDbList-sleutel in TMDb Helper."

